        "@value": "Chocolate & Confectionery",
        "@language": "en"
      },
      "skos:definition": {
        "@value": "Chocolate bars, drinking chocolate, cocoa butter, and sugar confectionery — combining roasted cacao beans with cane sugar, aromatic spices (vanilla, cinnamon, cloves, cassia), gums, almonds, starches, and milk.",
