        "@value": "Varnish, Paint & Lacquer",
        "@language": "en"
      },
      "skos:definition": {
        "@value": "Spirit and oil varnishes, japans, lacquers, French polish, and house/marine paints — dissolving tropical resins (copal, dammar, shellac, mastic, sandarac, amber, elemi, rosin) in linseed oil, turpentine, and spirits, pigmented with white lead, vermilion, ochre, umber, ultramarine, and chrome yellow.",
